// Ledger trace service: read access to the event log for the UI.
//
// Served by the Go trace server (server/) and by `ledger ui` (ledger/ui/),
// which must answer every RPC identically. Both are thin readers of the
// SQLite log the Python runtime writes; diffing, timeline layout and blame
// display happen in the UI, so neither server interprets more than it must.
//
